    "summary": "When the battle ends, the player with more VP wins; equal VP is a draw. Each player whose army is painted Battle Ready scores 10VP.\n\nVP above these caps are ignored:\n\n- **PRIMARY MISSION**: 45VP, at most 15VP each battle round\n- **SECONDARY MISSIONS**: 45VP, at most 15VP each battle round and 20VP from each Fixed Secondary Mission card\n- **BATTLE READY ARMY**: 10VP",
